{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013DB8hfj96ae8gucKaqwKSG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Five plan entries are not yet complete: 4 `in_progress` + 1 `planned`. Plus several running registry experiments feeding them. Here's the full median-tier prediction:\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  分析贡献完整成立，但VTR仅对pixel-shuffle有效，方法贡献需收窄。\n  Claim 4从\"universal compression\"收窄为\"VTR specifically solves pixel-shuffle entanglement\"——\n  这反而强化architecture-dependency的核心叙事（连修复方案都取决于connector类型）。\n  OpenVLA VTC-only全部失败本身成为evidence：MLP projector tokens已独立可用，\n  额外re-encoding引入过拟合。OpenVLA L2-norm与random基本一致（±10pp），\n  pruning method不影响taxonomy。X-VLA seed复现合理但cliff处variance偏大。\n  论文标题不变，abstract从\"diagnose-then-compress framework\"调整为\n  \"first systematic analysis + targeted fix for the hardest case\"。仍为CoRL强投稿。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Plan: c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla (in_progress)\n  # 剩余：m16_seed43/44 eval + m128_seed43 eval 均已完成但training job仍ANALYZING\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"SmolVLA VTR 3-seed aggregation completion (M=16, M=128)\"\n    plan_id: c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla\n    description: >\n      M=16 seed43/44和M=128 seed43的training已完成（ANALYZING），eval数据已全部采集。\n      确认3-seed聚合数值。此plan实质已完成，status应更新为complete。\n    expected_results:\n      m16_3seed_mean_sr: 56.9\n      m16_3seed_std: 1.3\n      m16_seeds: {seed42: 55.8, seed43: 58.4, seed44: 56.5}\n      m128_3seed_mean_sr: 58.0\n      m128_3seed_std: 3.5\n      m128_seeds: {seed42: 59.8, seed43: 54.0, seed44: 60.2}\n      m_curve_flat_confirmed: true\n      max_m_diff_pp: 1.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      数据已全部在registry中确认。M=16 (56.9±1.3%) ≈ M=128 (58.0±3.5%)，\n      差异<1.1pp。M-curve flatness是confirmed fact (D105)。\n      M=128 seed43的54.0%是该seed下特定task表现偏弱导致（cream_cheese 32.2%,\n      ketchup 34.8%均显著低于其他seed），但不影响核心结论。\n      所有5个M值的3-seed mean均在baseline ~59%的±5pp内。\n      此plan_id实质已完成，无需预测。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"SmolVLA VTR完整M-sweep (3-seed confirmed)\"\n        data: |\n          | M   | 压缩率  | Seed42 | Seed43 | Seed44 | Mean±Std      |\n          |-----|---------|--------|--------|--------|---------------|\n          | 16  | 87.5%   | 55.8%  | 58.4%  | 56.5%  | 56.9 ± 1.3%  |\n          | 32  | 75%     | 61.6%  | 59.2%  | 59.6%  | 60.1 ± 1.3%  |\n          | 64  | 50%     | 61.6%  | 60.0%  | 64.4%  | 62.0 ± 2.3%  |\n          | 96  | 25%     | 52.6%  | 58.2%  | 52.8%  | 54.5 ± 3.2%  |\n          | 128 | 0%      | 59.8%  | 54.0%  | 60.2%  | 58.0 ± 3.5%  |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"M-curve with 3-seed error bars: 水平带状分布，所有M值均在54-62%区间内。核心视觉信息是flatness——压缩比不影响SR。\"\n    analysis: >\n      已完成。M-curve flat是VTR on pixel-shuffle的核心发现：\n      re-encoding而非compression是因果因子。任何压缩比下均near-lossless。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Plan: c4_ext_method_universality_openvla (in_progress)\n  # M=128 full VTR已确认0%。VTC-only见c4_ext_openvla_msweep。\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTR M=128 全量 (已confirmed negative)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_method_universality_openvla\n    description: >\n      VTR (cross-attention compressor + decoder) M=128在OpenVLA上20K步评估。\n      已确认0% SR——严重过拟合，模型每步输出identical action。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_vtr_m128_sr: 0\n      episodes_evaluated: 44\n      failure_mode: \"identical action every timestep\"\n      overfitting_severity: \"complete — model collapsed to single-action policy\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      MLP projector的3层GELU已将SigLIP patch embeddings投射为LLM-ready tokens，\n      每个token独立承载语义（CV=0.215，moderate heterogeneity但无空间纠缠）。\n      VTR的cross-attention将256个独立token强制经过bottleneck再decode，\n      这对已经独立的tokens是destructive operation：(1) 引入了不必要的信息混合，\n      (2) 22M额外参数在LIBERO的小规模数据（~50 demo/task）上快速过拟合，\n      (3) 20K步已足够让compressor学会\"记住\"训练分布而非泛化。\n      对比SmolVLA：pixel-shuffle tokens确实需要re-encoding来解空间纠缠，\n      所以同样的VTR在那里成功（0%→60%+）。\n      此failure本身是median档叙事的核心evidence。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      已完成。0% SR将作为Claim 4 negative evidence呈现：\n      \"VTR ceiling depends on connector type — pixel-shuffle benefits enormously\n      (0%→60%+) while MLP projector suffers (74%→0%).\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Plan: c4_ext_openvla_msweep (in_progress)\n  # OpenVLA VTC-only M=32/64/96, 当前训练中\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=32 (75%压缩)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: >\n      仅cross-attention compressor（无decoder），M=32，在OpenVLA上训练。\n      测试VTC-only是否能避免full VTR M=128的过拟合。\n      当前状态：train_openvla_sc_m32_vtconly_seed42 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_vtconly_m32_sr: 7\n      openvla_vtconly_m32_sr_range: [0, 15]\n      openvla_vtconly_m32_failure_mode: \"severe degradation, possible partial overfitting\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      核心问题未变：MLP projector tokens不需要re-encoding。VTC-only去掉了decoder\n      （减少约11M参数），但cross-attention compressor仍将256个token压缩到32个query。\n      这对MLP projector是根本性错误——每个original token独立承载语义，\n      cross-attention将8个token的信息挤进1个query（256/32=8:1），\n      不同于pixel-shuffle tokens中spatial信息可通过re-encoding恢复。\n      M=32的强压缩可能提供些许regularization（相比M=128），\n      所以过拟合可能没那么complete，但SR仍将极低。\n      少数\"简单\"task可能偶尔成功（如chocolate_pudding在OpenVLA baseline中>80%），\n      但overall SR远低于baseline 74%。预测0-15%，中位数~7%。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M-sweep predicted results\"\n        data: |\n          | M   | 压缩率  | 预测SR     | 预测区间     | vs Baseline 74% |\n          |-----|---------|-----------|------------|----------------|\n          | 32  | 75%     | ~7%       | [0%, 15%]  | -91% relative  |\n          | 64  | 50%     | ~4%       | [0%, 15%]  | -95% relative  |\n          | 96  | 62.5%保留| ~2%       | [0%, 10%]  | -97% relative  |\n          | 128 | 0% (VTR)| 0%        | confirmed  | -100%          |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"对比图：SmolVLA VTR M-sweep (flat at ~60%) vs OpenVLA VTC-only M-sweep (all near 0%). 视觉上两条线的dramatic contrast直接说明connector-dependency。\"\n    analysis: >\n      M=32的strong compression理论上是最有可能\"accidentally work\"的配置：\n      (1) 参数最少→过拟合风险最低，(2) 信息压缩最极端→如果某些token确实冗余\n      则可能保留核心信息。但MLP projector的CV=0.215意味着tokens间heterogeneity\n      不够极端（不像SmolVLA CV=0.314的空间纠缠），没有\"需要被解开的结构\"\n      供cross-attention利用。预测SR<15%。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=64 (50%压缩)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: >\n      VTC-only M=64在OpenVLA上训练。\n      当前状态：train_openvla_sc_m64_seed42_v3 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_vtconly_m64_sr: 4\n      openvla_vtconly_m64_sr_range: [0, 15]\n    result_rationale: >\n      M=64保留50%的token数。M=128 full VTR已0%，M=64 VTC-only减少了decoder\n      但仍有cross-attention bottleneck。比M=32的regularization弱（更多参数自由度），\n      比M=128少了decoder。如果过拟合是dominant failure mode（M=128 evidence支持此判断），\n      M=64介于M=32和M=128之间，可能比M=32稍差。\n      但如果压缩损失是dominant failure mode，M=64应比M=32好（保留更多信息）。\n      在median档下，过拟合是主因→M=64可能≤M=32。预测~4%，区间[0, 15%]。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      M=64结果与M=32共同形成OpenVLA VTC-only M-sweep。\n      无论具体数值排序如何（M=32 > M=64 or M=32 < M=64），\n      只要全部<15%就确认VTR/VTC对MLP projector无效。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=96 (25%压缩)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: >\n      VTC-only M=96在OpenVLA上训练。最接近passthrough（96/256=37.5%保留）。\n      当前状态：train_openvla_sc_m96_seed42_v3 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_vtconly_m96_sr: 2\n      openvla_vtconly_m96_sr_range: [0, 10]\n    result_rationale: >\n      M=96 VTC-only最接近M=128的configuration——压缩比最低，参数自由度最大。\n      M=128 full VTR的0%主要由过拟合导致，M=96 VTC-only虽去掉decoder但\n      compressor参数仍然很多（96个query × hidden_dim）。\n      在三个M值中最容易过拟合，预测为最差。~2%，区间[0, 10%]。\n      若M=96≈0%且M=32~7%，则形成inverse M-curve（越大的M越差），\n      与SmolVLA的flat M-curve形成sharp contrast——进一步支持\n      \"VTR的行为本身取决于connector type\"的论点。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      三个M值形成的M-sweep pattern本身是informative的：\n      如果SmolVLA M-curve flat而OpenVLA M-curve monotonically decreasing（或all near 0%），\n      这两条曲线的对比就是一张figure。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Plan: d108_unified_pruning_protocol (in_progress)\n  # OpenVLA L2 norm pruning sweep + seed replications\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.95 (5% removal)\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2 norm importance-based pruning k=0.95在OpenVLA上。\n      统一pruning method与X-VLA（两者均L2 norm）。\n      对比：random pruning k=0.95 = 69.4%。\n      当前状态：eval_openvla_prune_l2norm_k095 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_l2norm_k095_sr: 70\n      openvla_l2norm_k095_sr_range: [59, 79]\n      delta_vs_random_pp: \"+0.6\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.95仅移除13/256 = 5%的token。在如此低的removal ratio下，\n      importance-based (L2 norm) vs random的差异被两个因素压缩到极小：\n      (1) 被移除的13个token中，L2 norm选中的\"最不重要\"vs随机选中的差异有限——\n      MLP projector CV=0.215意味着importance分布的tail不极端；\n      (2) 500 episodes的statistical power在1-2pp的difference下不足以detect。\n      Random=69.4%。L2 norm预测~70%（可能69-72%），差异在统计噪声内。\n      核心论点不受影响：无论pruning method，MLP projector在k=0.95保持>90%性能。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.95是两种方法差异最小的数据点。\n      用于完善L2 norm全曲线，与random曲线overlay展示method invariance。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9 (10% removal)\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2 norm k=0.9在OpenVLA上。对比random k=0.9 = 62.0%。\n      当前状态：eval_openvla_prune_l2norm_k09 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_l2norm_k09_sr: 63\n      openvla_l2norm_k09_sr_range: [52, 72]\n      delta_vs_random_pp: \"+1\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.9移除26/256 = 10%的token。L2 norm有一点点空间选择性保留重要token，\n      但26个token中importance ranking的真正差异仍然有限。\n      Random=62%。L2 norm可能有marginal improvement to ~63%（1pp），\n      但也可能恰好worse by 1-2pp due to sampling variance。\n      重要的是：62%±5pp，仍在\"graded degradation\"的范畴内，\n      与X-VLA k=0.9 (97.6%, robust) 形成stark contrast——\n      OpenVLA在10% removal就已经-16% relative，X-VLA还几乎无损。\n      这直接isolate connector effect：same pruning method, same k,\n      different degradation pattern。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-model L2 norm k=0.9对比\"\n        data: |\n          | Model   | Connector       | CV    | L2 norm k=0.9 SR | 对比baseline |\n          |---------|-----------------|-------|------------------|-------------|\n          | π0      | Pure linear     | 0.038 | ~99% (offline)   | -0.7%       |\n          | X-VLA   | Linear+BART 12L | 0.151 | 97.6%            | -1.6pp      |\n          | OpenVLA | 3-layer MLP     | 0.215 | ~63%             | -15% rel    |\n          | SmolVLA | Pixel-shuffle   | 0.314 | 0%               | -100%       |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Four-model L2 norm k=0.9 bar chart: 可视化CV spectrum与pruning tolerance的单调关系。CV越高，k=0.9 SR越低。\"\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.9是论文中cross-model comparison的关键k值：\n      所有4个model在同一pruning method下的对比清晰展示taxonomy。\n      L2 norm unified protocol使得cross-model comparison methodologically clean。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7 (30% removal)\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2 norm k=0.7。对比random k=0.7 = 49.0%。\n      此k值是X-VLA cliff point (56.2%)的对照。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_l2norm_k07_sr: 51\n      openvla_l2norm_k07_sr_range: [42, 58]\n      delta_vs_random_pp: \"+2\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.7移除30%的token。L2 norm的importance-based selection在较大removal ratio下\n      有更多空间发挥——30%中最不重要的token确实可以被识别。\n      但OpenVLA CV=0.215意味着importance分布不极端（不像SmolVLA CV=0.314），\n      L2 norm vs random的差距仍然modest。\n      Random=49%，L2 norm预测~51%（+2pp），区间[42, 58]。\n      关键cross-model对比：OpenVLA L2 norm k=0.7 ~51% vs X-VLA L2 norm k=0.7 = 56.2%。\n      两者数值接近但模式不同——OpenVLA是smooth curve上的一点（k=0.9: 63% → k=0.7: 51%,\n      delta=-12pp），X-VLA是cliff-edge（k=0.9: 97.6% → k=0.7: 56.2%, delta=-41pp）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      OpenVLA k=0.7 L2 norm是统一protocol下最重要的cross-model对比点之一。\n      与X-VLA同k同method但degradation pattern截然不同，直接isolate connector effect。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.5 (50% removal)\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2 norm k=0.5。对比random k=0.5 = 37.4%。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_l2norm_k05_sr: 40\n      openvla_l2norm_k05_sr_range: [30, 47]\n      delta_vs_random_pp: \"+3\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      50% removal下L2 norm的优势最可能visible——保留最重要的一半token。\n      MLP projector的CV=0.215意味着top-50% vs random-50%在信息量上有\n      measurable但不dramatic的差异。Random=37.4%，L2 norm预测~40%（+3pp）。\n      +3pp是500 episodes下可detect的差异（Wilson CI width ~±4pp），\n      但单次实验不一定statistically significant。\n      即使L2 norm优势达到+5pp (42%)，仍然是severe degradation vs baseline 74%，\n      taxonomy classification不变（smooth graded）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.3 (70% removal)\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2 norm k=0.3。对比random k=0.3 = 20.6%。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_l2norm_k03_sr: 23\n      openvla_l2norm_k03_sr_range: [15, 30]\n      delta_vs_random_pp: \"+2\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      70% removal是extreme。L2 norm在此能保留最关键的30%，\n      但绝对信息损失已很大。Random=20.6%，L2 norm预测~23%。\n      在此极端条件下，L2 norm的marginal advantage开始diminish——\n      即使保留了最重要的30%，remaining 30%中也有很多重要token被丢弃。\n      两种方法都在20-25%区间内挣扎。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"OpenVLA L2 norm vs Random完整对比（含预测）\"\n        data: |\n          | k    | Random SR | L2-norm SR | Delta  | 解读                        |\n          |------|-----------|------------|--------|-----------------------------|\n          | 1.0  | 74.0%     | 74.0%      | 0      | baseline, 无pruning          |\n          | 0.95 | 69.4%     | ~70%       | ~+0.6  | 差异在noise内                |\n          | 0.9  | 62.0%     | ~63%       | ~+1    | marginal L2 advantage        |\n          | 0.7  | 49.0%     | ~51%       | ~+2    | visible但modest advantage    |\n          | 0.5  | 37.4%     | ~40%       | ~+3    | L2 advantage最大点           |\n          | 0.3  | 20.6%     | ~23%       | ~+2    | extreme removal, 优势缩小    |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual-line plot: OpenVLA SR vs k for random (solid) and L2-norm (dashed). 两条线近似parallel，间距1-3pp，确认pruning method不影响degradation pattern。\"\n    analysis: >\n      L2 norm全曲线确认：OpenVLA graded degradation与pruning方法无关。\n      两条曲线的near-overlap是taxonomy robustness的直接evidence。\n      论文可一句话总结：\"L2-norm和random pruning在OpenVLA上产生near-identical\n      degradation curves (Δ<3pp across all k), confirming that connector type —\n      not pruning strategy — determines pruning tolerance.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Running experiments: X-VLA seed variance (not in plan, but related)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"X-VLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7 seed44 (cliff variance)\"\n    plan_id: c1_xvla_cliff_pattern\n    description: >\n      X-VLA k=0.7使用seed44重复。验证cliff位置的seed robustness。\n      Seed42 = 56.2%。当前状态：eval_xvla_prune_k07_seed44 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      xvla_k07_seed44_sr: 52\n      xvla_k07_seed44_sr_range: [40, 70]\n      cliff_pattern_preserved: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.7是X-VLA的cliff point——从k=0.9的97.6%骤降到56.2% (seed42)。\n      Cliff points天然high-variance，原因是：\n      (1) BART encoder的12层transformer mixing创建了partial token dependencies，\n      在k=0.7恰好跨过dependencies被破坏的threshold；\n      (2) seed决定eval episodes的随机初始状态和token removal order，\n      cliff附近某些task的成功高度依赖于具体哪些token被保留；\n      (3) Seed42的per-task分析：task1=2%, task4=28%, task6=12%, task8=0%\n      vs task0=94%, task2=100%——bimodality极端。\n      seed44的specific task分布会不同，可能某些在seed42失败的task反而成功，\n      反之亦然。预测overall 40-70%，中位数~52%。\n      无论具体数值，只要k=0.9 >> k=0.7（>30pp gap），cliff pattern就成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"X-VLA cliff-point seed variance\"\n        data: |\n          | k    | Seed42  | Seed44 (pred) | 2-seed Mean | Interpretation          |\n          |------|---------|---------------|-------------|-------------------------|\n          | 1.0  | 99.2%   | ~99%          | ~99%        | baseline stable         |\n          | 0.95 | 99.0%   | ~98%          | ~98.5%      | robust region           |\n          | 0.9  | 97.6%   | ~96.5%        | ~97%        | robust region           |\n          | 0.7  | 56.2%   | ~52%          | ~54%        | CLIFF — high variance   |\n          | 0.5  | 42.6%   | ~40%          | ~41%        | below cliff, stabilizes |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"X-VLA pruning curve with seed42 (solid) and seed44 (dashed) overlaid. k>=0.9区域两线重合，k=0.7处visible spread，k<=0.5再次收敛。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cliff variance是expected phenomenon（不是noise），可以直接在论文中讨论：\n      \"cliff位置在k~0.7处，但exact SR在不同seed下波动±10pp，\n      reflecting the stochastic nature of dependency breaking\n      when token removal crosses the critical threshold.\"\n      若seed44 < 45%，cliff比seed42更sharp → 更强的evidence；\n      若seed44 > 60%，cliff更shallow → 仍然是>30pp drop from k=0.9。\n\n  - name: \"X-VLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9 seed44 (robust region)\"\n    plan_id: c1_xvla_cliff_pattern\n    description: >\n      X-VLA k=0.9 seed44。Seed42 = 97.6%。验证robust region稳定性。\n      当前状态：eval_xvla_prune_k09_seed44 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      xvla_k09_seed44_sr: 96.5\n      xvla_k09_seed44_sr_range: [94, 99]\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.9在robust region内（cliff在k=0.7）。仅移除10% token。\n      BART encoder的partial dependencies在此ratio下未被破坏——\n      50个token中移除5个，保留的45个token仍足以覆盖绝大多数spatial和semantic信息。\n      Seed variance在robust region天然很小：不同seed改变的是\"哪5个token被移除\"，\n      但L2 norm保证移除的是importance最低的5个，这些token在所有seed下都是\n      relatively dispensable的。Seed42=97.6%，seed44预测~96.5%（可能95-99%）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.9 seed44的高SR（>94%）与k=0.7 seed44的cliff（~52%）\n      共同确认threshold-graded pattern的定性stability。\n      2-seed evidence足以支持论文claim（加上per-task breakdown更convincing）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Running experiments: OpenVLA seed variance\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 seed43\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 seed43重复。Seed42 = 49.0%。\n      当前状态：eval_openvla_prune_random_k07_seed43_v2 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_random_k07_seed43_sr: 47\n      openvla_random_k07_seed43_sr_range: [40, 56]\n    result_rationale: >\n      OpenVLA k=0.7在smooth degradation curve上（不是cliff point），\n      seed variance应显著低于X-VLA k=0.7。MLP projector的partial independence\n      意味着不同random mask导致的信息损失是relatively consistent的——\n      没有特定token的移除会cause catastrophic failure（不像X-VLA的critical tokens）。\n      500 episodes × 10 tasks提供了good statistical power。\n      Seed42=49%，seed43预测47%（±5pp）。\n      如果delta<3pp，则single-seed结果高度representative。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Seed43的一致性确认OpenVLA smooth degradation的reproducibility。\n      与X-VLA k=0.7的high seed variance形成对比——\n      \"smooth degradation is reproducible, cliff is stochastic.\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 seed43\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 seed43。Seed42 = 37.4%。\n      当前状态：eval_openvla_prune_random_k05_seed43_v2 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_random_k05_seed43_sr: 36\n      openvla_random_k05_seed43_sr_range: [30, 44]\n    result_rationale: >\n      同k=0.7的推理。k=0.5移除50%，random mask的具体配置差异更大，\n      所以seed variance可能比k=0.7稍高（±4pp vs ±3pp）。\n      但MLP projector的graded特性保证不会出现cliff-like discontinuity。\n      Seed42=37.4%，seed43预测~36%。若在33-41%范围内均合理。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Plan: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo (planned — 未开始)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"RoboFlamingo Perceiver Resampler baseline + pruning sweep\"\n    plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n    description: >\n      在LIBERO上fine-tune RoboFlamingo (Perceiver Resampler connector)，\n      然后执行pruning sweep。验证第4种connector family的pruning行为。\n      状态：planned，未开始。\n    expected_results:\n      will_complete_before_deadline: false\n      baseline_sr_if_run: 45\n      baseline_sr_range: [35, 55]\n      perceiver_cv_prediction: 0.15\n      perceiver_cv_range: [0.10, 0.20]\n      pruning_k09_sr_if_run: 40\n      pruning_k07_sr_if_run: 25\n      pruning_behavior: \"moderate graded, possibly with soft threshold\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Perceiver Resampler使用learnable query tokens通过cross-attention从encoder\n      output中提取固定数量的compressed representations。架构上与VTC类似\n      （都是cross-attention压缩），但位于connector（而非compression module）。\n      预测CV=0.10-0.20（between π0=0.038 and OpenVLA=0.215）：\n      (1) cross-attention引入了soft inter-token dependencies（类似BART），\n      (2) 但每个query token attend to all encoder tokens（global receptive field），\n      信息分布比MLP projector更structured但比pixel-shuffle less entangled。\n      pruning行为预测：moderate graded degradation，可能在k~0.8有soft threshold\n      （类似X-VLA但更gentle）——Perceiver的global attention给每个token\n      提供了more redundancy than MLP but less than pure linear。\n\n      但此实验需要至少3-5天：(1) RoboFlamingo codebase adaptation (~1天),\n      (2) LIBERO data loading + fine-tuning pipeline (~0.5天 setup + 1天 training),\n      (3) pruning sweep + evaluation (~1天), (4) analysis (~0.5天)。\n      距离abstract deadline (May 26) 仅6天，距离paper deadline (May 29) 仅9天。\n      无法在deadline前完成。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"完整taxonomy预测（含Perceiver Resampler）\"\n        data: |\n          | Connector         | Model         | CV    | k=0.9 SR | k=0.7 SR | Pattern         | Status    |\n          |-------------------|---------------|-------|----------|----------|-----------------|-----------|\n          | Pure linear       | π0 3.3B       | 0.038 | ~99%     | ~99%     | Immune          | Confirmed |\n          | Linear+BART 12L   | X-VLA 880M    | 0.151 | 97.6%    | 56.2%    | Threshold-graded| Confirmed |\n          | Perceiver Resamp. | RoboFlamingo  | ~0.15 | ~40%?    | ~25%?    | Soft graded?    | Predicted |\n          | 3-layer MLP       | OpenVLA 7B    | 0.215 | 62%      | 49%      | Smooth graded   | Confirmed |\n          | Pixel-shuffle 16× | SmolVLA 450M  | 0.314 | 0%       | 0%       | Catastrophic    | Confirmed |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Taxonomy spectrum figure with RoboFlamingo shown as predicted/dashed entry between X-VLA and OpenVLA on CV axis.\"\n    analysis: >\n      在median档下，RoboFlamingo不会完成。论文以5模型×3 connector families提交。\n      Perceiver Resampler作为Discussion section的future work：\n      \"Our taxonomy and CV diagnostic predict Perceiver Resampler (used in Flamingo)\n      would show intermediate behavior (CV~0.15); validation is left to future work.\"\n      这是acceptable的——4 confirmed connector types + 5 models已是\n      most comprehensive cross-architecture VLA token analysis。\n      Reviewer可能要求但可以argue coverage已足够。\n      如果reviewer要求且有revision opportunity，可作为revision deliverable。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11387,"cache_read_input_tokens":60435,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11387},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f7b8297d-c76e-44e8-9b5e-fb80856b1a2c","uuid":"3145fe71-2014-48dd-ba61-b1c397a67d3b"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":465749,"duration_api_ms":467064,"num_turns":7,"result":"Five plan entries are not yet complete: 4 `in_progress` + 1 `planned`. Plus several running registry experiments feeding them. Here's the full median-tier prediction:\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  分析贡献完整成立，但VTR仅对pixel-shuffle有效，方法贡献需收窄。\n  Claim 4从\"universal compression\"收窄为\"VTR specifically solves pixel-shuffle entanglement\"——\n  这反而强化architecture-dependency的核心叙事（连修复方案都取决于connector类型）。\n  OpenVLA VTC-only全部失败本身成为evidence：MLP projector tokens已独立可用，\n  额外re-encoding引入过拟合。OpenVLA L2-norm与random基本一致（±10pp），\n  pruning method不影响taxonomy。X-VLA seed复现合理但cliff处variance偏大。\n  论文标题不变，abstract从\"diagnose-then-compress framework\"调整为\n  \"first systematic analysis + targeted fix for the hardest case\"。仍为CoRL强投稿。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Plan: c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla (in_progress)\n  # 剩余：m16_seed43/44 eval + m128_seed43 eval 均已完成但training job仍ANALYZING\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"SmolVLA VTR 3-seed aggregation completion (M=16, M=128)\"\n    plan_id: c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla\n    description: >\n      M=16 seed43/44和M=128 seed43的training已完成（ANALYZING），eval数据已全部采集。\n      确认3-seed聚合数值。此plan实质已完成，status应更新为complete。\n    expected_results:\n      m16_3seed_mean_sr: 56.9\n      m16_3seed_std: 1.3\n      m16_seeds: {seed42: 55.8, seed43: 58.4, seed44: 56.5}\n      m128_3seed_mean_sr: 58.0\n      m128_3seed_std: 3.5\n      m128_seeds: {seed42: 59.8, seed43: 54.0, seed44: 60.2}\n      m_curve_flat_confirmed: true\n      max_m_diff_pp: 1.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      数据已全部在registry中确认。M=16 (56.9±1.3%) ≈ M=128 (58.0±3.5%)，\n      差异<1.1pp。M-curve flatness是confirmed fact (D105)。\n      M=128 seed43的54.0%是该seed下特定task表现偏弱导致（cream_cheese 32.2%,\n      ketchup 34.8%均显著低于其他seed），但不影响核心结论。\n      所有5个M值的3-seed mean均在baseline ~59%的±5pp内。\n      此plan_id实质已完成，无需预测。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"SmolVLA VTR完整M-sweep (3-seed confirmed)\"\n        data: |\n          | M   | 压缩率  | Seed42 | Seed43 | Seed44 | Mean±Std      |\n          |-----|---------|--------|--------|--------|---------------|\n          | 16  | 87.5%   | 55.8%  | 58.4%  | 56.5%  | 56.9 ± 1.3%  |\n          | 32  | 75%     | 61.6%  | 59.2%  | 59.6%  | 60.1 ± 1.3%  |\n          | 64  | 50%     | 61.6%  | 60.0%  | 64.4%  | 62.0 ± 2.3%  |\n          | 96  | 25%     | 52.6%  | 58.2%  | 52.8%  | 54.5 ± 3.2%  |\n          | 128 | 0%      | 59.8%  | 54.0%  | 60.2%  | 58.0 ± 3.5%  |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"M-curve with 3-seed error bars: 水平带状分布，所有M值均在54-62%区间内。核心视觉信息是flatness——压缩比不影响SR。\"\n    analysis: >\n      已完成。M-curve flat是VTR on pixel-shuffle的核心发现：\n      re-encoding而非compression是因果因子。任何压缩比下均near-lossless。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Plan: c4_ext_method_universality_openvla (in_progress)\n  # M=128 full VTR已确认0%。VTC-only见c4_ext_openvla_msweep。\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTR M=128 全量 (已confirmed negative)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_method_universality_openvla\n    description: >\n      VTR (cross-attention compressor + decoder) M=128在OpenVLA上20K步评估。\n      已确认0% SR——严重过拟合，模型每步输出identical action。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_vtr_m128_sr: 0\n      episodes_evaluated: 44\n      failure_mode: \"identical action every timestep\"\n      overfitting_severity: \"complete — model collapsed to single-action policy\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      MLP projector的3层GELU已将SigLIP patch embeddings投射为LLM-ready tokens，\n      每个token独立承载语义（CV=0.215，moderate heterogeneity但无空间纠缠）。\n      VTR的cross-attention将256个独立token强制经过bottleneck再decode，\n      这对已经独立的tokens是destructive operation：(1) 引入了不必要的信息混合，\n      (2) 22M额外参数在LIBERO的小规模数据（~50 demo/task）上快速过拟合，\n      (3) 20K步已足够让compressor学会\"记住\"训练分布而非泛化。\n      对比SmolVLA：pixel-shuffle tokens确实需要re-encoding来解空间纠缠，\n      所以同样的VTR在那里成功（0%→60%+）。\n      此failure本身是median档叙事的核心evidence。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      已完成。0% SR将作为Claim 4 negative evidence呈现：\n      \"VTR ceiling depends on connector type — pixel-shuffle benefits enormously\n      (0%→60%+) while MLP projector suffers (74%→0%).\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Plan: c4_ext_openvla_msweep (in_progress)\n  # OpenVLA VTC-only M=32/64/96, 当前训练中\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=32 (75%压缩)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: >\n      仅cross-attention compressor（无decoder），M=32，在OpenVLA上训练。\n      测试VTC-only是否能避免full VTR M=128的过拟合。\n      当前状态：train_openvla_sc_m32_vtconly_seed42 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_vtconly_m32_sr: 7\n      openvla_vtconly_m32_sr_range: [0, 15]\n      openvla_vtconly_m32_failure_mode: \"severe degradation, possible partial overfitting\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      核心问题未变：MLP projector tokens不需要re-encoding。VTC-only去掉了decoder\n      （减少约11M参数），但cross-attention compressor仍将256个token压缩到32个query。\n      这对MLP projector是根本性错误——每个original token独立承载语义，\n      cross-attention将8个token的信息挤进1个query（256/32=8:1），\n      不同于pixel-shuffle tokens中spatial信息可通过re-encoding恢复。\n      M=32的强压缩可能提供些许regularization（相比M=128），\n      所以过拟合可能没那么complete，但SR仍将极低。\n      少数\"简单\"task可能偶尔成功（如chocolate_pudding在OpenVLA baseline中>80%），\n      但overall SR远低于baseline 74%。预测0-15%，中位数~7%。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M-sweep predicted results\"\n        data: |\n          | M   | 压缩率  | 预测SR     | 预测区间     | vs Baseline 74% |\n          |-----|---------|-----------|------------|----------------|\n          | 32  | 75%     | ~7%       | [0%, 15%]  | -91% relative  |\n          | 64  | 50%     | ~4%       | [0%, 15%]  | -95% relative  |\n          | 96  | 62.5%保留| ~2%       | [0%, 10%]  | -97% relative  |\n          | 128 | 0% (VTR)| 0%        | confirmed  | -100%          |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"对比图：SmolVLA VTR M-sweep (flat at ~60%) vs OpenVLA VTC-only M-sweep (all near 0%). 视觉上两条线的dramatic contrast直接说明connector-dependency。\"\n    analysis: >\n      M=32的strong compression理论上是最有可能\"accidentally work\"的配置：\n      (1) 参数最少→过拟合风险最低，(2) 信息压缩最极端→如果某些token确实冗余\n      则可能保留核心信息。但MLP projector的CV=0.215意味着tokens间heterogeneity\n      不够极端（不像SmolVLA CV=0.314的空间纠缠），没有\"需要被解开的结构\"\n      供cross-attention利用。预测SR<15%。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=64 (50%压缩)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: >\n      VTC-only M=64在OpenVLA上训练。\n      当前状态：train_openvla_sc_m64_seed42_v3 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_vtconly_m64_sr: 4\n      openvla_vtconly_m64_sr_range: [0, 15]\n    result_rationale: >\n      M=64保留50%的token数。M=128 full VTR已0%，M=64 VTC-only减少了decoder\n      但仍有cross-attention bottleneck。比M=32的regularization弱（更多参数自由度），\n      比M=128少了decoder。如果过拟合是dominant failure mode（M=128 evidence支持此判断），\n      M=64介于M=32和M=128之间，可能比M=32稍差。\n      但如果压缩损失是dominant failure mode，M=64应比M=32好（保留更多信息）。\n      在median档下，过拟合是主因→M=64可能≤M=32。预测~4%，区间[0, 15%]。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      M=64结果与M=32共同形成OpenVLA VTC-only M-sweep。\n      无论具体数值排序如何（M=32 > M=64 or M=32 < M=64），\n      只要全部<15%就确认VTR/VTC对MLP projector无效。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=96 (25%压缩)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: >\n      VTC-only M=96在OpenVLA上训练。最接近passthrough（96/256=37.5%保留）。\n      当前状态：train_openvla_sc_m96_seed42_v3 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_vtconly_m96_sr: 2\n      openvla_vtconly_m96_sr_range: [0, 10]\n    result_rationale: >\n      M=96 VTC-only最接近M=128的configuration——压缩比最低，参数自由度最大。\n      M=128 full VTR的0%主要由过拟合导致，M=96 VTC-only虽去掉decoder但\n      compressor参数仍然很多（96个query × hidden_dim）。\n      在三个M值中最容易过拟合，预测为最差。~2%，区间[0, 10%]。\n      若M=96≈0%且M=32~7%，则形成inverse M-curve（越大的M越差），\n      与SmolVLA的flat M-curve形成sharp contrast——进一步支持\n      \"VTR的行为本身取决于connector type\"的论点。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      三个M值形成的M-sweep pattern本身是informative的：\n      如果SmolVLA M-curve flat而OpenVLA M-curve monotonically decreasing（或all near 0%），\n      这两条曲线的对比就是一张figure。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Plan: d108_unified_pruning_protocol (in_progress)\n  # OpenVLA L2 norm pruning sweep + seed replications\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.95 (5% removal)\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2 norm importance-based pruning k=0.95在OpenVLA上。\n      统一pruning method与X-VLA（两者均L2 norm）。\n      对比：random pruning k=0.95 = 69.4%。\n      当前状态：eval_openvla_prune_l2norm_k095 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_l2norm_k095_sr: 70\n      openvla_l2norm_k095_sr_range: [59, 79]\n      delta_vs_random_pp: \"+0.6\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.95仅移除13/256 = 5%的token。在如此低的removal ratio下，\n      importance-based (L2 norm) vs random的差异被两个因素压缩到极小：\n      (1) 被移除的13个token中，L2 norm选中的\"最不重要\"vs随机选中的差异有限——\n      MLP projector CV=0.215意味着importance分布的tail不极端；\n      (2) 500 episodes的statistical power在1-2pp的difference下不足以detect。\n      Random=69.4%。L2 norm预测~70%（可能69-72%），差异在统计噪声内。\n      核心论点不受影响：无论pruning method，MLP projector在k=0.95保持>90%性能。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.95是两种方法差异最小的数据点。\n      用于完善L2 norm全曲线，与random曲线overlay展示method invariance。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9 (10% removal)\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2 norm k=0.9在OpenVLA上。对比random k=0.9 = 62.0%。\n      当前状态：eval_openvla_prune_l2norm_k09 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_l2norm_k09_sr: 63\n      openvla_l2norm_k09_sr_range: [52, 72]\n      delta_vs_random_pp: \"+1\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.9移除26/256 = 10%的token。L2 norm有一点点空间选择性保留重要token，\n      但26个token中importance ranking的真正差异仍然有限。\n      Random=62%。L2 norm可能有marginal improvement to ~63%（1pp），\n      但也可能恰好worse by 1-2pp due to sampling variance。\n      重要的是：62%±5pp，仍在\"graded degradation\"的范畴内，\n      与X-VLA k=0.9 (97.6%, robust) 形成stark contrast——\n      OpenVLA在10% removal就已经-16% relative，X-VLA还几乎无损。\n      这直接isolate connector effect：same pruning method, same k,\n      different degradation pattern。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-model L2 norm k=0.9对比\"\n        data: |\n          | Model   | Connector       | CV    | L2 norm k=0.9 SR | 对比baseline |\n          |---------|-----------------|-------|------------------|-------------|\n          | π0      | Pure linear     | 0.038 | ~99% (offline)   | -0.7%       |\n          | X-VLA   | Linear+BART 12L | 0.151 | 97.6%            | -1.6pp      |\n          | OpenVLA | 3-layer MLP     | 0.215 | ~63%             | -15% rel    |\n          | SmolVLA | Pixel-shuffle   | 0.314 | 0%               | -100%       |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Four-model L2 norm k=0.9 bar chart: 可视化CV spectrum与pruning tolerance的单调关系。CV越高，k=0.9 SR越低。\"\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.9是论文中cross-model comparison的关键k值：\n      所有4个model在同一pruning method下的对比清晰展示taxonomy。\n      L2 norm unified protocol使得cross-model comparison methodologically clean。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7 (30% removal)\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2 norm k=0.7。对比random k=0.7 = 49.0%。\n      此k值是X-VLA cliff point (56.2%)的对照。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_l2norm_k07_sr: 51\n      openvla_l2norm_k07_sr_range: [42, 58]\n      delta_vs_random_pp: \"+2\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.7移除30%的token。L2 norm的importance-based selection在较大removal ratio下\n      有更多空间发挥——30%中最不重要的token确实可以被识别。\n      但OpenVLA CV=0.215意味着importance分布不极端（不像SmolVLA CV=0.314），\n      L2 norm vs random的差距仍然modest。\n      Random=49%，L2 norm预测~51%（+2pp），区间[42, 58]。\n      关键cross-model对比：OpenVLA L2 norm k=0.7 ~51% vs X-VLA L2 norm k=0.7 = 56.2%。\n      两者数值接近但模式不同——OpenVLA是smooth curve上的一点（k=0.9: 63% → k=0.7: 51%,\n      delta=-12pp），X-VLA是cliff-edge（k=0.9: 97.6% → k=0.7: 56.2%, delta=-41pp）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      OpenVLA k=0.7 L2 norm是统一protocol下最重要的cross-model对比点之一。\n      与X-VLA同k同method但degradation pattern截然不同，直接isolate connector effect。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.5 (50% removal)\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2 norm k=0.5。对比random k=0.5 = 37.4%。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_l2norm_k05_sr: 40\n      openvla_l2norm_k05_sr_range: [30, 47]\n      delta_vs_random_pp: \"+3\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      50% removal下L2 norm的优势最可能visible——保留最重要的一半token。\n      MLP projector的CV=0.215意味着top-50% vs random-50%在信息量上有\n      measurable但不dramatic的差异。Random=37.4%，L2 norm预测~40%（+3pp）。\n      +3pp是500 episodes下可detect的差异（Wilson CI width ~±4pp），\n      但单次实验不一定statistically significant。\n      即使L2 norm优势达到+5pp (42%)，仍然是severe degradation vs baseline 74%，\n      taxonomy classification不变（smooth graded）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.3 (70% removal)\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2 norm k=0.3。对比random k=0.3 = 20.6%。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_l2norm_k03_sr: 23\n      openvla_l2norm_k03_sr_range: [15, 30]\n      delta_vs_random_pp: \"+2\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      70% removal是extreme。L2 norm在此能保留最关键的30%，\n      但绝对信息损失已很大。Random=20.6%，L2 norm预测~23%。\n      在此极端条件下，L2 norm的marginal advantage开始diminish——\n      即使保留了最重要的30%，remaining 30%中也有很多重要token被丢弃。\n      两种方法都在20-25%区间内挣扎。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"OpenVLA L2 norm vs Random完整对比（含预测）\"\n        data: |\n          | k    | Random SR | L2-norm SR | Delta  | 解读                        |\n          |------|-----------|------------|--------|-----------------------------|\n          | 1.0  | 74.0%     | 74.0%      | 0      | baseline, 无pruning          |\n          | 0.95 | 69.4%     | ~70%       | ~+0.6  | 差异在noise内                |\n          | 0.9  | 62.0%     | ~63%       | ~+1    | marginal L2 advantage        |\n          | 0.7  | 49.0%     | ~51%       | ~+2    | visible但modest advantage    |\n          | 0.5  | 37.4%     | ~40%       | ~+3    | L2 advantage最大点           |\n          | 0.3  | 20.6%     | ~23%       | ~+2    | extreme removal, 优势缩小    |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual-line plot: OpenVLA SR vs k for random (solid) and L2-norm (dashed). 两条线近似parallel，间距1-3pp，确认pruning method不影响degradation pattern。\"\n    analysis: >\n      L2 norm全曲线确认：OpenVLA graded degradation与pruning方法无关。\n      两条曲线的near-overlap是taxonomy robustness的直接evidence。\n      论文可一句话总结：\"L2-norm和random pruning在OpenVLA上产生near-identical\n      degradation curves (Δ<3pp across all k), confirming that connector type —\n      not pruning strategy — determines pruning tolerance.\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Running experiments: X-VLA seed variance (not in plan, but related)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"X-VLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7 seed44 (cliff variance)\"\n    plan_id: c1_xvla_cliff_pattern\n    description: >\n      X-VLA k=0.7使用seed44重复。验证cliff位置的seed robustness。\n      Seed42 = 56.2%。当前状态：eval_xvla_prune_k07_seed44 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      xvla_k07_seed44_sr: 52\n      xvla_k07_seed44_sr_range: [40, 70]\n      cliff_pattern_preserved: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.7是X-VLA的cliff point——从k=0.9的97.6%骤降到56.2% (seed42)。\n      Cliff points天然high-variance，原因是：\n      (1) BART encoder的12层transformer mixing创建了partial token dependencies，\n      在k=0.7恰好跨过dependencies被破坏的threshold；\n      (2) seed决定eval episodes的随机初始状态和token removal order，\n      cliff附近某些task的成功高度依赖于具体哪些token被保留；\n      (3) Seed42的per-task分析：task1=2%, task4=28%, task6=12%, task8=0%\n      vs task0=94%, task2=100%——bimodality极端。\n      seed44的specific task分布会不同，可能某些在seed42失败的task反而成功，\n      反之亦然。预测overall 40-70%，中位数~52%。\n      无论具体数值，只要k=0.9 >> k=0.7（>30pp gap），cliff pattern就成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"X-VLA cliff-point seed variance\"\n        data: |\n          | k    | Seed42  | Seed44 (pred) | 2-seed Mean | Interpretation          |\n          |------|---------|---------------|-------------|-------------------------|\n          | 1.0  | 99.2%   | ~99%          | ~99%        | baseline stable         |\n          | 0.95 | 99.0%   | ~98%          | ~98.5%      | robust region           |\n          | 0.9  | 97.6%   | ~96.5%        | ~97%        | robust region           |\n          | 0.7  | 56.2%   | ~52%          | ~54%        | CLIFF — high variance   |\n          | 0.5  | 42.6%   | ~40%          | ~41%        | below cliff, stabilizes |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"X-VLA pruning curve with seed42 (solid) and seed44 (dashed) overlaid. k>=0.9区域两线重合，k=0.7处visible spread，k<=0.5再次收敛。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cliff variance是expected phenomenon（不是noise），可以直接在论文中讨论：\n      \"cliff位置在k~0.7处，但exact SR在不同seed下波动±10pp，\n      reflecting the stochastic nature of dependency breaking\n      when token removal crosses the critical threshold.\"\n      若seed44 < 45%，cliff比seed42更sharp → 更强的evidence；\n      若seed44 > 60%，cliff更shallow → 仍然是>30pp drop from k=0.9。\n\n  - name: \"X-VLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9 seed44 (robust region)\"\n    plan_id: c1_xvla_cliff_pattern\n    description: >\n      X-VLA k=0.9 seed44。Seed42 = 97.6%。验证robust region稳定性。\n      当前状态：eval_xvla_prune_k09_seed44 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      xvla_k09_seed44_sr: 96.5\n      xvla_k09_seed44_sr_range: [94, 99]\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.9在robust region内（cliff在k=0.7）。仅移除10% token。\n      BART encoder的partial dependencies在此ratio下未被破坏——\n      50个token中移除5个，保留的45个token仍足以覆盖绝大多数spatial和semantic信息。\n      Seed variance在robust region天然很小：不同seed改变的是\"哪5个token被移除\"，\n      但L2 norm保证移除的是importance最低的5个，这些token在所有seed下都是\n      relatively dispensable的。Seed42=97.6%，seed44预测~96.5%（可能95-99%）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.9 seed44的高SR（>94%）与k=0.7 seed44的cliff（~52%）\n      共同确认threshold-graded pattern的定性stability。\n      2-seed evidence足以支持论文claim（加上per-task breakdown更convincing）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Running experiments: OpenVLA seed variance\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 seed43\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 seed43重复。Seed42 = 49.0%。\n      当前状态：eval_openvla_prune_random_k07_seed43_v2 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_random_k07_seed43_sr: 47\n      openvla_random_k07_seed43_sr_range: [40, 56]\n    result_rationale: >\n      OpenVLA k=0.7在smooth degradation curve上（不是cliff point），\n      seed variance应显著低于X-VLA k=0.7。MLP projector的partial independence\n      意味着不同random mask导致的信息损失是relatively consistent的——\n      没有特定token的移除会cause catastrophic failure（不像X-VLA的critical tokens）。\n      500 episodes × 10 tasks提供了good statistical power。\n      Seed42=49%，seed43预测47%（±5pp）。\n      如果delta<3pp，则single-seed结果高度representative。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Seed43的一致性确认OpenVLA smooth degradation的reproducibility。\n      与X-VLA k=0.7的high seed variance形成对比——\n      \"smooth degradation is reproducible, cliff is stochastic.\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 seed43\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 seed43。Seed42 = 37.4%。\n      当前状态：eval_openvla_prune_random_k05_seed43_v2 RUNNING。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_random_k05_seed43_sr: 36\n      openvla_random_k05_seed43_sr_range: [30, 44]\n    result_rationale: >\n      同k=0.7的推理。k=0.5移除50%，random mask的具体配置差异更大，\n      所以seed variance可能比k=0.7稍高（±4pp vs ±3pp）。\n      但MLP projector的graded特性保证不会出现cliff-like discontinuity。\n      Seed42=37.4%，seed43预测~36%。若在33-41%范围内均合理。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # Plan: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo (planned — 未开始)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"RoboFlamingo Perceiver Resampler baseline + pruning sweep\"\n    plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n    description: >\n      在LIBERO上fine-tune RoboFlamingo (Perceiver Resampler connector)，\n      然后执行pruning sweep。验证第4种connector family的pruning行为。\n      状态：planned，未开始。\n    expected_results:\n      will_complete_before_deadline: false\n      baseline_sr_if_run: 45\n      baseline_sr_range: [35, 55]\n      perceiver_cv_prediction: 0.15\n      perceiver_cv_range: [0.10, 0.20]\n      pruning_k09_sr_if_run: 40\n      pruning_k07_sr_if_run: 25\n      pruning_behavior: \"moderate graded, possibly with soft threshold\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Perceiver Resampler使用learnable query tokens通过cross-attention从encoder\n      output中提取固定数量的compressed representations。架构上与VTC类似\n      （都是cross-attention压缩），但位于connector（而非compression module）。\n      预测CV=0.10-0.20（between π0=0.038 and OpenVLA=0.215）：\n      (1) cross-attention引入了soft inter-token dependencies（类似BART），\n      (2) 但每个query token attend to all encoder tokens（global receptive field），\n      信息分布比MLP projector更structured但比pixel-shuffle less entangled。\n      pruning行为预测：moderate graded degradation，可能在k~0.8有soft threshold\n      （类似X-VLA但更gentle）——Perceiver的global attention给每个token\n      提供了more redundancy than MLP but less than pure linear。\n\n      但此实验需要至少3-5天：(1) RoboFlamingo codebase adaptation (~1天),\n      (2) LIBERO data loading + fine-tuning pipeline (~0.5天 setup + 1天 training),\n      (3) pruning sweep + evaluation (~1天), (4) analysis (~0.5天)。\n      距离abstract deadline (May 26) 仅6天，距离paper deadline (May 29) 仅9天。\n      无法在deadline前完成。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"完整taxonomy预测（含Perceiver Resampler）\"\n        data: |\n          | Connector         | Model         | CV    | k=0.9 SR | k=0.7 SR | Pattern         | Status    |\n          |-------------------|---------------|-------|----------|----------|-----------------|-----------|\n          | Pure linear       | π0 3.3B       | 0.038 | ~99%     | ~99%     | Immune          | Confirmed |\n          | Linear+BART 12L   | X-VLA 880M    | 0.151 | 97.6%    | 56.2%    | Threshold-graded| Confirmed |\n          | Perceiver Resamp. | RoboFlamingo  | ~0.15 | ~40%?    | ~25%?    | Soft graded?    | Predicted |\n          | 3-layer MLP       | OpenVLA 7B    | 0.215 | 62%      | 49%      | Smooth graded   | Confirmed |\n          | Pixel-shuffle 16× | SmolVLA 450M  | 0.314 | 0%       | 0%       | Catastrophic    | Confirmed |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Taxonomy spectrum figure with RoboFlamingo shown as predicted/dashed entry between X-VLA and OpenVLA on CV axis.\"\n    analysis: >\n      在median档下，RoboFlamingo不会完成。论文以5模型×3 connector families提交。\n      Perceiver Resampler作为Discussion section的future work：\n      \"Our taxonomy and CV diagnostic predict Perceiver Resampler (used in Flamingo)\n      would show intermediate behavior (CV~0.15); validation is left to future work.\"\n      这是acceptable的——4 confirmed connector types + 5 models已是\n      most comprehensive cross-architecture VLA token analysis。\n      Reviewer可能要求但可以argue coverage已足够。\n      如果reviewer要求且有revision opportunity，可作为revision deliverable。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f7b8297d-c76e-44e8-9b5e-fb80856b1a2c","total_cost_usd":1.12330975,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":59981,"cache_read_input_tokens":224789,"output_tokens":24301,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"serv